WEBVTT

NOTE
Shiva - Diamond Dust. Ice queen summon.
Observed duration in reference video: ~28 seconds.

00:00.000 --> 00:02.500
Shiva. Diamond Dust.

00:02.500 --> 00:08.000
The battlefield freezes. Sheets of ice climb skyward and form a glittering cathedral.

00:08.000 --> 00:14.000
Shiva descends through the ice — blue-skinned, long flowing hair, frost-blue robes.

00:14.000 --> 00:19.000
She glides forward and raises both hands; a halo of jagged ice forms behind her.

00:19.000 --> 00:25.000
Shiva fires a beam of diamond dust; the enemies are sealed in shattering ice.

00:25.000 --> 00:28.000
The ice splinters and falls away as she vanishes.
